      <h1 class="article-title">The Book of Common Prayer</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">1928</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">The 1928 American Book of Common Prayer, including the Daily Office, Holy Communion, Sacramental Rites, the Psalter, and the Ordinal.</p>
      <hr class="faith-doc-rule" aria-hidden="true">
      
      <div class="faith-doc-actions">
        
